    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decided to go on a roadtrip, you drive while conversating with your loved one, &amp; getting out to distract yourself from life's uncertainties. It abruptly comes to an nightmarish end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/733dc5eb819dd46d0df8e47ef1b48d27.poster.avif?t=1750616234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/733dc5eb819dd46d0df8e47ef1b48d27.webm?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/733dc5eb819dd46d0df8e47ef1b48d27.mp4?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merciless Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspenseful thriller that grips you and will not let go. Ignoring Jumpscares &amp; Focusing on detailed atmospheric horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/12a0f62174ec59f3fc3a424c03a4e9bd.poster.avif?t=1750616234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/12a0f62174ec59f3fc3a424c03a4e9bd.webm?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/12a0f62174ec59f3fc3a424c03a4e9bd.mp4?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound Design Priority</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Design created from scratch, with more than 800 sounds combined used to amplify scenes. From changing how the rain is heard getting in &amp; out of a car to using real phone calls. Familiar sounds suddenly changes as the game progresses, but why?<br>Every Sound you hear was made with a purpose in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/6a382f4517004d80caec5a8de8b07e68.poster.avif?t=1750616234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/6a382f4517004d80caec5a8de8b07e68.webm?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/6a382f4517004d80caec5a8de8b07e68.mp4?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Written to have environmental foreshadowing, &amp; cinematic like shots that furthers emotion. Following only 2 Protagonists in their spiral, having great  voice actors was an priority. Using an authentic relationship they share in real life was even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/d5b832baf94e8ea2cf5e6e63a51094b0.poster.avif?t=1750616234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/d5b832baf94e8ea2cf5e6e63a51094b0.webm?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/d5b832baf94e8ea2cf5e6e63a51094b0.mp4?t=1750616234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bite Size Terrors:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short experimental horror experiences each with their own unique genres and styles belonging in the same universe.\u00a0<br>Hidden meanings that focuses on a human mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455820/extras/422cf890a69acd99089884aaf31709db.avif?t=1750616234\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
